		subject_in = 'Pengembalian Ganda Top-up pada Tes Data-Wipe',
		subject = 'Double Top-up Refund during Data-Wipe Test',
		content_cn = '#C0xffe672##F24#Kính gửi Tamers: \n \n Với sự hỗ trợ của các bạn, "Digimon Adventure" cuối cùng đã mở ra thử nghiệm không xóa. Để đền đáp những người huấn luyện thú đã làm việc chăm chỉ với chúng tôi trong thế giới kỹ thuật số, giờ đây chúng tôi sẽ nhân đôi số tiền nạp lại mà bạn đã chi tiêu trong thời gian xóa (kim cương quà tặng không nằm trong phạm vi hoàn lại tiền và số tiền hoàn lại gấp đôi chỉ có thể được yêu cầu trong một khu vực). \n Đứa trẻ được chọn, hãy bắt đầu cuộc phiêu lưu! \n Nhóm điều hành "Digimon Adventure"',
		content_vn = '#C0xffe672##F24#Dear Tamers: \n \n With your support, "Digimon Adventure" has finally launched the non-data-wipe test. To thank the tamers who worked hard with us in the digital world, we are now doubling the top-up amount you spent during the data wipe period (gift diamonds are not eligible for refund, and the double refund can only be claimed in one zone). \n Chosen Child, let the adventure begin! \n Digimon Adventure Operations Team  ',
		content = '#C0xffe672##F24#Dear Tamers: \n \n With your support, "Digimon Adventure" has finally launched the non-data-wipe test. To thank the tamers who worked hard with us in the digital world, we are now doubling the top-up amount you spent during the data wipe period (gift diamonds are not eligible for refund, and the double refund can only be claimed in one zone). \n Chosen Child, let the adventure begin! \n Digimon Adventure Operations Team  ',
		content_ma = '#C0xffe672##F24#Para Penjinak yang dihormati: \n \n Dengan sokongan anda, "Digimon Adventure" akhirnya dibuka untuk ujian tanpa padam data. Untuk membalas jasa para Penjinak yang telah berjuang bersama kami dalam dunia digital, kami akan menggandakan jumlah top-up yang anda lakukan semasa fasa ujian padam (hadiah berlian tidak termasuk dalam pemulangan dan penggandaan hanya sah di satu pelayan). \n Anak-anak terpilih, mari mulakan pengembaraan! \n Pasukan Operasi "Digimon Adventure"',
		content_ph = '#C0xffe672##F24#Minamahal na Tamers: \n \n Sa suporta ninyo, sa wakas ay nabuksan na ang non-wipe test ng “Digimon Adventure”. Bilang pasasalamat sa mga trainer na masigasig na nakipagsapalaran sa amin sa digital world, dodoblehin namin ngayon ang halaga ng iyong na-recharge noong panahon ng wipe (hindi kasama ang gift diamonds sa refund at ang dobleng refund ay maaaring i-claim sa isang zone lamang). \n Napiling bata, simulan na ang pakikipagsapalaran! \n – Koponang Tagapangasiwa ng “Digimon Adventure”',
		content_en = '#C0xffe672##F24#Dear Tamers: \n \n With your support, "Digimon Adventure" has finally launched the non-data-wipe test. To thank the tamers who worked hard with us in the digital world, we are now doubling the top-up amount you spent during the data wipe period (gift diamonds are not eligible for refund, and the double refund can only be claimed in one zone). \n Chosen Child, let the adventure begin! \n Digimon Adventure Operations Team  ',
		content_th = '#C0xffe672##F24#เรียน Tamers: \n \n ด้วยการสนับสนุนของทุกท่าน "Digimon Adventure" ได้เริ่มการทดสอบแบบไม่ลบข้อมูลแล้ว เพื่อเป็นการขอบคุณ Tamer ที่ร่วมเดินทางในโลกดิจิทัลกับเรา เราจะคืนเงินเติมที่ใช้ไปในช่วงทดสอบให้เป็น 2 เท่า (ไม่รวมเพชรของขวัญ และสามารถขอรับได้เฉพาะในพื้นที่เดียวเท่านั้น) \n เด็กที่ถูกเลือก จงออกผจญภัยกันเถอะ! \n ทีมงาน "Digimon Adventure"',
		content_in = '#C0xffe672##F24#Kepada Para Pelatih: \n \n Dengan dukungan kalian, "Digimon Adventure" akhirnya memulai fase uji coba tanpa penghapusan data. Untuk membalas para pelatih yang telah berjuang bersama kami di dunia digital, kami akan menggandakan jumlah top-up yang Anda habiskan selama masa penghapusan data (hadiah diamond tidak termasuk dalam pengembalian, dan penggandaan hanya dapat diklaim di satu server). \n Anak-anak terpilih, mari kita mulai petualangan! \n Tim Operasional "Digimon Adventure"  '
	},
