		subject_ma = 'Ucapan Selamat Tahun Baru',
		subject_ph = 'Maligayang Bagong Taon!',
		subject_en = 'New Year Greetings',
		subject_vn = 'New Year Greetings',
		subject_th = 'คำอวยพรปีใหม่',
		subject_in = 'Ucapan Tahun Baru',
		subject = 'New Year Greetings',
		attachs = {[700] = 1, __size = 1},
		content_cn = 'Những người thuần hóa đang gặp khó khăn:\n Chúc mừng năm mới. Một năm mới đã đến với thế giới loài người, và trò chơi nhàm chán này được tạo ra bởi những kẻ lập kế hoạch ngu ngốc như chúng ta sẽ sớm đồng hành cùng bạn trong nửa năm. Kể từ khi ra mắt, chúng tôi đã luôn nghĩ đến việc làm thế nào để thu hút người chơi keng (hai), thử mọi cách để tạo ra lỗi và mang lại lợi ích cho người chơi. Bởi vì chúng tôi vẫn chưa quên mục đích ban đầu của mình - làm thế nào để khôi phục lại một thế giới kỹ thuật số đích thực trong thế giới thực. Vì vậy, chúng tôi khác biệt với những trò chơi kỹ thuật số kém chất lượng khác. Chúng tôi không thô bạo đến thế. Kể cả khi phải bán thận vì thiếu kinh phí, chúng tôi vẫn phải khắc họa đầy đủ chi tiết của thế giới số (đội ngũ phát triển không còn đủ thận nữa). \n Chúng tôi không biết xấu hổ khi nói rằng chúng tôi hy vọng rằng trò chơi kỹ thuật số tinh tế nhất hiện có trên thị trường này có thể đồng hành cùng bạn trong năm nay, năm sau và hàng năm để tìm thấy "giấc mơ vô hạn" đó.',
		content_vn = 'Dear struggling Tamers:\n Happy New Year. A new year has come to the human world, and this boring game created by foolish planners like us will soon accompany you for half a year. Since launch, we\'ve constantly thought of ways to attract "bling" (players), trying all means to produce bugs and benefit players. Because we have not forgotten our original goal – to truly recreate the digital world in the real world. That\'s why we are different from other low-quality digital games. We’re not that crude. Even if we have to sell kidneys due to lack of funds, we must fully portray the details of the digital world (the dev team is out of kidneys). \n Shameless as it may sound, we hope that this most refined digital game on the market can be with you this year, next year, and every year to come to find that "infinite dream".',
		content = 'Dear struggling Tamers:\n Happy New Year. A new year has come to the human world, and this boring game created by foolish planners like us will soon accompany you for half a year. Since launch, we\'ve constantly thought of ways to attract "bling" (players), trying all means to produce bugs and benefit players. Because we have not forgotten our original goal – to truly recreate the digital world in the real world. That\'s why we are different from other low-quality digital games. We’re not that crude. Even if we have to sell kidneys due to lack of funds, we must fully portray the details of the digital world (the dev team is out of kidneys). \n Shameless as it may sound, we hope that this most refined digital game on the market can be with you this year, next year, and every year to come to find that "infinite dream".',
		content_ma = 'Penjinak yang sedang menghadapi cabaran:\n Selamat Tahun Baru. Tahun baru telah tiba di dunia manusia, dan permainan membosankan ini yang dicipta oleh kami perancang bodoh akan menemani anda selama setengah tahun lagi. Sejak pelancaran, kami sentiasa mencari cara untuk menarik pemain (keng), mencuba pelbagai cara untuk mencipta pepijat dan memberi manfaat kepada pemain. Kerana kami tidak pernah lupa tujuan asal kami – untuk mencipta semula dunia digital sebenar dalam dunia nyata. Oleh itu, kami berbeza daripada permainan digital berkualiti rendah lain. Kami tidak seburuk itu. Walaupun perlu menjual buah pinggang kerana kekurangan dana, kami masih bertekad untuk melukis dunia digital secara terperinci (pasukan pembangunan kini tiada buah pinggang). \n Kami tidak malu untuk berkata bahawa kami berharap permainan digital paling halus ini di pasaran dapat menemani anda tahun ini, tahun hadapan, dan setiap tahun, untuk mencari "impian tanpa had" itu.',
		content_ph = 'Mga Tamer na nahihirapan:\n Maligayang Bagong Taon. Dumating na ang bagong taon sa mundo ng tao, at ang nakakainip na larong ito na gawa ng mga planner na tulad namin ay makakasama niyo na ng kalahating taon. Simula nang ilunsad, sinubukan naming aliwin ang mga manlalaro sa lahat ng paraan, kabilang ang paggawa ng bug, upang mabigyan kayo ng benepisyo. Hindi namin nakalimutan ang layunin: ibalik ang tunay na digital na mundo sa totoong mundo. Kaya kami\'y naiiba. Kahit kailangan naming ibenta ang aming kidney, itutuloy pa rin namin ang pagbibigay-buhay sa digital world (ubos na ang kidney ng dev team). \n Nais naming ang larong ito na pinaka-pinong digital game ay samahan kayo taon-taon upang mahanap ang "walang hanggang panaginip".  ',
		content_en = 'Dear struggling Tamers:\n Happy New Year. A new year has come to the human world, and this boring game created by foolish planners like us will soon accompany you for half a year. Since launch, we\'ve constantly thought of ways to attract "bling" (players), trying all means to produce bugs and benefit players. Because we have not forgotten our original goal – to truly recreate the digital world in the real world. That\'s why we are different from other low-quality digital games. We’re not that crude. Even if we have to sell kidneys due to lack of funds, we must fully portray the details of the digital world (the dev team is out of kidneys). \n Shameless as it may sound, we hope that this most refined digital game on the market can be with you this year, next year, and every year to come to find that "infinite dream".',
		content_th = 'เหล่าเทรนเนอร์ที่กำลังประสบปัญหา:\n สวัสดีปีใหม่ ปีใหม่ได้มาถึงโลกมนุษย์แล้ว และเกมสุดน่าเบื่อนี้ที่สร้างขึ้นโดยพวกนักวางแผนสุดงี่เง่าอย่างพวกเราก็กำลังจะร่วมเดินทางกับคุณมาครึ่งปีแล้ว ตั้งแต่วันเปิดตัว เราก็คิดอยู่เสมอว่าจะทำอย่างไรถึงจะดึงดูดผู้เล่นตัวจริงได้ เราพยายามทุกวิถีทางในการสร้างบัคและมอบผลประโยชน์ให้ผู้เล่น เพราะว่าเราไม่เคยลืมเป้าหมายแรกเริ่มของเราเลย — นั่นคือการฟื้นฟูโลกดิจิทัลที่แท้จริงให้กลับมาอยู่ในโลกแห่งความจริง ดังนั้นเราจึงแตกต่างจากเกมดิจิทัลคุณภาพต่ำอื่น ๆ เราไม่ได้หยาบคายขนาดนั้น แม้จะต้องขายไตเพราะขาดงบประมาณ เราก็ยังคงต้องถ่ายทอดรายละเอียดของโลกดิจิทัลให้ครบถ้วน (ตอนนี้ทีมพัฒนาไม่มีไตเหลือแล้ว) \n เราไม่อายที่จะบอกว่า เราหวังว่าเกมดิจิทัลที่ประณีตที่สุดเกมนี้จะสามารถอยู่เคียงข้างคุณได้ทั้งปีนี้ ปีหน้า และทุกปี เพื่อร่วมกันค้นหา “ความฝันที่ไร้ขีดจำกัด” นั้น',
		content_in = 'Penjinak yang terhormat:\n Selamat Tahun Baru. Tahun baru telah datang ke dunia manusia, dan permainan membosankan ini yang dibuat oleh perencana bodoh seperti kami akan segera menemani Anda selama setengah tahun. Sejak peluncuran, kami selalu memikirkan cara untuk menarik pemain keren (dua), mencoba berbagai cara untuk membuat bug dan memberi manfaat kepada pemain. Karena kami belum melupakan tujuan awal kami — bagaimana membangun kembali dunia digital sejati di dunia nyata. Oleh karena itu, kami berbeda dari game digital berkualitas rendah lainnya. Kami tidak sebrutal itu. Bahkan jika harus menjual ginjal karena kekurangan dana, kami tetap harus menggambarkan dunia digital dengan detail penuh (tim pengembang sudah tidak punya cukup ginjal lagi). \n Kami tanpa malu mengakui bahwa kami berharap game digital paling halus di pasar ini dapat menemani Anda tahun ini, tahun depan, dan setiap tahun untuk menemukan "mimpi tanpa batas" itu.'
	},
